---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
// Content ported verbatim from the original docs/ourgarage/support/ page
// (GitHub Pages), which now redirects here. Edit the text here from now on.
---
<Base
  title="Support | OurGarage"
  description="Get help with OurGarage: contact details, restoring purchases, household sharing, and deleting your account and data."
  path="/support/"
>
  <article class="wrap prose legal">
    <h1>OurGarage Support</h1>

    <p>Something not working, or have a question about the app? Email us and we'll
    get back to you.</p>

    <p class="mail"><a href="mailto:support@noktastudio.dev">support@noktastudio.dev</a></p>

    <h2>Before you write in</h2>
    <p>A couple of things that help us help you faster:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Which OurGarage feature you were using (adding a vehicle, a reminder,
      household sharing, restoring a purchase, etc.)</li>
      <li>Whether you're on the free tier or have OurGarage Premium</li>
      <li>Your device and iOS version, if it's a crash or display issue</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Common questions</h2>

    <h3>How do I restore a purchase on a new device?</h3>
    <p>Open Settings inside the app and tap <strong>Restore Purchases</strong>. This re-applies
    any Premium purchase already tied to your Apple ID.</p>

    <h3>How do I share my garage with my household?</h3>
    <p>Open a vehicle, tap the menu in the top corner, choose <strong>Share with
    household</strong>, and sign in with your Apple ID.
    You can then invite others with a one-time code that expires after seven
    days.</p>

    <h3>How do I export my records?</h3>
    <p>With OurGarage Premium, open Settings and tap <strong>Export records</strong>. Choose a
    CSV file of every vehicle and service (opens in Numbers, Excel or Google
    Sheets), or a PDF service history for one vehicle, which is handy when you
    sell a car.</p>

    <h3>How do I delete my account and data?</h3>
    <p>Open Settings and tap <strong>Delete account</strong> (shown once you have signed in),
    then confirm with Sign in with Apple. Everything on your phone stays; your
    account and the data shared through it are deleted from our servers. You
    can also email <a href="mailto:support@noktastudio.dev">support@noktastudio.dev</a> from
    the address associated with your account. See our
    <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
    for details on what happens to shared household data.</p>

    <h2>Legal</h2>
    <p>
    <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
    &middot;
    <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
